caption: Example
technology-rule: example

A chem grants a 100-point advantage with:

Reduced Duration, -40%

Nauseated Backlash, -30%

Its values are:

DPL: 30 points

BV: 60 points

The short duration reduces the actual benefit. The nausea makes the formula easier and cheaper to produce, but does not make the positive experience less addictive.
